<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>THE EDGE PERFORMANCE — Hervé Ngongo</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
:root {
  --gold: #C9A84C; --gold-light: #E8C97A; --gold-dark: #8B6914;
  --black: #080808; --black-2: #0F0F0F; --black-3: #181818; --black-4: #222;
  --white: #F5F0E8; --white-dim: rgba(245,240,232,0.65); --white-faint: rgba(245,240,232,0.12);
}
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body { background: var(--black); color: var(--white); font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.75; overflow-x: hidden; }

/* ── NAV ── */
nav {
  position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 200;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 1.4rem 5rem;
  background: rgba(8,8,8,0.96); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.15);
}
.nav-logo { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; color: var(--white); }
.nav-logo em { color: var(--gold); font-style: normal; }
.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2.8rem; list-style: none; }
.nav-links a { font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--white-dim); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s; }
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
.nav-cta { font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--black); background: var(--gold); padding: 0.7rem 1.8rem; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.25s; }
.nav-cta:hover { background: var(--gold-light); }

/* ── HERO ── */
.hero {
  min-height: 100vh; position: relative; display: flex; align-items: flex-end;
  padding: 0 5rem 6rem; overflow: hidden;
}
.hero-video-bg {
  position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background:
    linear-gradient(to right, rgba(8,8,8,0.92) 45%, rgba(8,8,8,0.3) 100%),
    linear-gradient(160deg, #0A0A0A 0%, #1a1208 50%, #0A0A0A 100%);
}
/* Animated grid */
.hero-grid {
  position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background-image:
    repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(201,168,76,0.04) 0px, rgba(201,168,76,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 80px),
    repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(201,168,76,0.04) 0px, rgba(201,168,76,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 80px);
}
/* SVG human figure silhouette top-right */
.hero-figure {
  position: absolute; right: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 52%;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.hero-figure svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; opacity: 0.07; }
/* Gold accent line left */
.hero-accent { position: absolute; left: 5rem; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 1px; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 5%, var(--gold) 25%, var(--gold) 75%, transparent 95%); opacity: 0.35; }

.hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 700px; }
.hero-tag {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem;
  font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold);
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}
.hero-tag::before { content: ""; display: block; width: 36px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold); }
.hero-h1 { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5.5vw, 5.5rem); line-height: 1.0; letter-spacing: 0.025em; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
.hero-h1 .g { color: var(--gold); }
.hero-tagline { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 1.25rem; font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; color: var(--white-dim); margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
.hero-sub { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--white-dim); max-width: 480px; line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
.hero-btns { display: flex; gap: 1.2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
.btn-gold { font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--black); background: var(--gold); padding: 1rem 2.5rem; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; transition: background 0.25s; }
.btn-gold:hover { background: var(--gold-light); }
.btn-ghost { font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--white-dim); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.4); padding-bottom: 3px; transition: all 0.25s; }
.btn-ghost:hover { color: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold); }
.hero-stats { display: flex; gap: 3rem; }
.hstat-n { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 3rem; color: var(--gold); line-height: 1; }
.hstat-l { font-size: 0.58rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--white-dim); margin-top: 0.2rem; }

/* ── DIVIDERS ── */
.divider { height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(201,168,76,0.3), transparent); }

/* ── SECTION BASE ── */
.s-pad { padding: 7rem 5rem; }
.s-eyebrow { font-size: 0.58rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem; }
.s-eyebrow::before { content: ""; display: block; width: 28px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold); }
.s-title { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem); letter-spacing: 0.04em; line-height: 1.0; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; color: var(--white); }
.s-intro { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 1.2rem; font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; color: var(--white-dim); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 620px; }

/* ── MISSION ── */
.mission { background: var(--black-2); }
.mission-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6rem; align-items: center; }
.mission-text {}
.mission-body { font-size: 0.83rem; color: var(--white-dim); line-height: 1.95; margin-top: 2rem; }
.mission-body strong { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600; }
.mission-visual {
  position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
}
/* Big quote visual */
.mission-quote-block {
  background: var(--black-3); border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.15);
  padding: 3rem; position: relative;
}
.mission-quote-block::before {
  content: "C"; font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
  font-size: 9rem; color: var(--gold); opacity: 0.15;
  position: absolute; top: -1.5rem; left: 1.5rem; line-height: 1;
}
.mission-quote { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 1.35rem; font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; color: var(--white); line-height: 1.7; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.mission-quote-attr { font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-top: 1.5rem; }
/* Pillars under */
.mission-pillars { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: rgba(201,168,76,0.12); margin-top: 3rem; }
.mpillar { background: var(--black-2); padding: 1.4rem 1rem; text-align: center; }
.mpillar-n { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 2.4rem; color: var(--gold); line-height: 1; }
.mpillar-l { font-size: 0.52rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--white-dim); margin-top: 0.3rem; }

/* ── FOUNDER ── */
.founder { background: var(--black); }
.founder-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 420px 1fr; gap: 6rem; align-items: start; }
.founder-photo-wrap { position: relative; flex-shrink: 0; }
.founder-photo-frame { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3/4; border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2); overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
.founder-photo-frame img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; display: block; }
.founder-photo-frame::after {
  content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(8,8,8,0.6) 0%, transparent 40%);
}
.fc { position: absolute; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-color: var(--gold); border-style: solid; opacity: 0.55; z-index: 2; }
.fc-tl { top: -7px; left: -7px; border-width: 2px 0 0 2px; }
.fc-tr { top: -7px; right: -7px; border-width: 2px 2px 0 0; }
.fc-bl { bottom: -7px; left: -7px; border-width: 0 0 2px 2px; }
.fc-br { bottom: -7px; right: -7px; border-width: 0 2px 2px 0; }
.founder-badge { position: absolute; bottom: -1.2rem; right: -1.2rem; background: var(--gold); color: var(--black); padding: 1rem 1.3rem; text-align: center; z-index: 3; }
.founder-badge-n { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1; }
.founder-badge-l { font-size: 0.5rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.founder-text { padding-top: 0.5rem; }
.founder-name { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem); letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--white); margin-top: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
.founder-role { font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
.founder-quote { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 1.2rem; font-style: italic; color: var(--white-dim); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 2rem; border-left: 2px solid var(--gold); padding-left: 1.5rem; }
.founder-body { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--white-dim); line-height: 1.95; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
/* Sport badges */
.sport-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
.stag { font-size: 0.55rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); background: rgba(201,168,76,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2); padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem; }
/* 3 differentiators */
.diff-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 1px; background: rgba(201,168,76,0.12); margin-top: 1rem; }
.diff-card { background: var(--black-2); padding: 1.5rem 1.2rem; }
.diff-num { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 1.8rem; color: rgba(201,168,76,0.25); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.diff-title { font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.diff-body { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--white-dim); line-height: 1.7; }

/* ── OFFERS ── */
.offers { background: var(--black-2); }
.offers-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 4rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; }
.offers-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: rgba(201,168,76,0.12); }
.offer-card { background: var(--black-3); padding: 2.5rem 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition: background 0.3s; }
.offer-card:hover { background: var(--black-4); }
.offer-card.featured { background: var(--black-4); border-top: 2px solid var(--gold); }
.offer-num { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 4rem; color: rgba(201,168,76,0.1); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: -0.8rem; }
.offer-name { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 1.9rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
.offer-sub { font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.offer-desc { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--white-dim); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.offer-goals { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 2rem; flex: 1; }
.offer-goals li { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--white-dim); padding: 0.45rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.08); display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.7rem; }
.offer-goals li::before { content: ""; display: block; width: 4px; height: 4px; background: var(--gold); margin-top: 0.45rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
.offer-price-wrap { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.15); }
.offer-price-from { font-size: 0.52rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--white-dim); }
.offer-price { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 2.8rem; color: var(--gold); line-height: 1.1; }
.offer-price-unit { font-size: 0.58rem; color: var(--white-dim); margin-top: 0.2rem; }

/* ── WHY BLOCK ── */
.why-block { background: var(--gold); padding: 6rem 5rem; }
.why-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr; gap: 6rem; align-items: center; }
.why-title { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); color: var(--black); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.why-body { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--black); opacity: 0.8; line-height: 1.95; }
.why-chain { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
.wchain-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 1.1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
.wchain-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.wchain-icon { width: 42px; height: 42px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.12); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
.wchain-icon svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; stroke: var(--black); fill: none; stroke-width: 1.8; }
.wchain-title { font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--black); margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
.wchain-desc { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--black); opacity: 0.72; line-height: 1.6; }
/* Equation */
.equation { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.eq-block { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--black); background: rgba(0,0,0,0.1); padding: 0.5rem 1rem; }
.eq-arrow { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--black); opacity: 0.5; }

/* ── VISION ── */
.vision { background: var(--black-3); }
.vision-inner { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
.vision-inner .s-eyebrow { justify-content: center; }
.vision-inner .s-eyebrow::before { display: none; }
.vision-body { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--white-dim); line-height: 2; margin-top: 2rem; }
.vision-manifesto { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: rgba(201,168,76,0.12); margin-top: 4rem; text-align: left; }
.vm-item { background: var(--black-2); padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
.vm-num { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 3rem; color: rgba(201,168,76,0.15); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.vm-title { font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }
.vm-body { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--white-dim); line-height: 1.75; }

/* ── CONTACT ── */
.contact { background: var(--black-2); text-align: center; }
.contact-inner { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; }
.contact-eyebrow { justify-content: center; }
.contact-eyebrow::before { display: none; }
.contact-title { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
.contact-sub { font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif; font-size: 1.15rem; font-style: italic; color: var(--white-dim); margin-bottom: 3rem; line-height: 1.7; }
.contact-details { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 4rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.cdet-label { font-size: 0.52rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
.cdet-val { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--white-dim); }

/* ── FOOTER ── */
footer { background: var(--black); padding: 2rem 5rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.1); flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; }
.footer-logo { font-family: "Bebas Neue", sans-serif; font-size: 1.1rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; }
.footer-logo em { color: var(--gold); font-style: normal; }
.footer-copy { font-size: 0.58rem; color: var(--white-dim); opacity: 0.4; }
.footer-loc { font-size: 0.58rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); opacity: 0.6; }

/* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  nav { padding: 1rem 1.5rem; } .nav-links { display: none; }
  .hero { padding: 7rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
  .s-pad { padding: 4.5rem 1.5rem; }
  .mission-inner, .founder-inner, .why-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
  .offers-grid, .diff-grid, .vision-manifesto { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .hero-stats { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; }
  footer { padding: 1.5rem; }
  .why-block { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="nav-logo">THE <em>EDGE</em> PERFORMANCE</div>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#mission">Mission</a></li>
    <li><a href="#founder">Fondateur</a></li>
    <li><a href="#offers">Programmes</a></li>
    <li><a href="#why">Pourquoi nous</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
  <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Session découverte</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-video-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-grid"></div>
  <!-- Abstract human movement SVG background -->
  <div class="hero-figure">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 600 800" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="0.8">
      <!-- Stylized human in motion -->
      <circle cx="300" cy="80" r="45" />
      <line x1="300" y1="125" x2="300" y2="320" />
      <line x1="300" y1="180" x2="180" y2="280" />
      <line x1="300" y1="180" x2="420" y2="260" />
      <line x1="300" y1="320" x2="220" y2="480" />
      <line x1="300" y1="320" x2="390" y2="500" />
      <line x1="220" y1="480" x2="200" y2="640" />
      <line x1="390" y1="500" x2="420" y2="650" />
      <!-- Dynamic energy lines -->
      <path d="M 80 200 Q 200 150 180 280" stroke-dasharray="4 8" opacity="0.4"/>
      <path d="M 520 160 Q 400 200 420 310" stroke-dasharray="4 8" opacity="0.4"/>
      <path d="M 100 400 Q 160 500 220 480" stroke-dasharray="4 8" opacity="0.3"/>
      <path d="M 500 420 Q 440 500 390 500" stroke-dasharray="4 8" opacity="0.3"/>
      <!-- Circles of energy -->
      <circle cx="300" cy="400" r="200" stroke-dasharray="2 12" opacity="0.15"/>
      <circle cx="300" cy="400" r="280" stroke-dasharray="2 16" opacity="0.08"/>
      <!-- Small node points -->
      <circle cx="180" cy="280" r="5" fill="#C9A84C" opacity="0.5"/>
      <circle cx="420" cy="260" r="5" fill="#C9A84C" opacity="0.5"/>
      <circle cx="200" cy="640" r="5" fill="#C9A84C" opacity="0.5"/>
      <circle cx="420" cy="650" r="5" fill="#C9A84C" opacity="0.5"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-accent"></div>

  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-tag">Facilitateur de Dynamiques Humaines par le Mouvement</div>
    <h1 class="hero-h1">
      MOVE BETTER.<br><span class="g">PERFORM</span> BETTER.
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-tagline">La performance durable commence par l'énergie humaine.</p>
    <p class="hero-sub">Remettre le mouvement au cœur du quotidien professionnel parce qu'une équipe qui bouge est une équipe qui respire, qui échange, et qui progresse ensemble.</p>
    <div class="hero-btns">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-gold">Réserver une session découverte</a>
      <a href="#mission" class="btn-ghost">Découvrir notre approche</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div><div class="hstat-n">+15</div><div class="hstat-l">Années terrain</div></div>
      <div><div class="hstat-n">+30</div><div class="hstat-l">Équipes managées</div></div>
      <div><div class="hstat-n">3.5M€</div><div class="hstat-l">CA en 5 ans</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="divider"></div>

<!-- MISSION -->
<section class="mission s-pad" id="mission">
  <div class="mission-inner">
    <div class="mission-text">
      <div class="s-eyebrow">Notre mission</div>
      <h2 class="s-title">UNE APPROCHE DIFFÉRENTE DE LA PERFORMANCE</h2>
      <p class="mission-body">
        Depuis l'aube de l'humanité, notre survie et notre développement ont reposé sur un besoin fondamental : <strong>bouger ensemble</strong>.<br><br>
        Aujourd'hui, dans un environnement où les collaborateurs passent une grande partie de leur journée assis, la sédentarité est devenue un enjeu majeur.<br><br>
        Fatigue, baisse de concentration, stress, manque d'interactions, perte d'engagement : ces phénomènes ont un impact direct sur la performance collective.<br><br>
        Chaque organisation est animée par des <strong>dynamiques humaines invisibles</strong> qui influencent directement sa performance : l'énergie des collaborateurs, la qualité des interactions, l'engagement individuel, la confiance collective.<br><br>
        Lorsque ces dynamiques sont positives, les équipes collaborent mieux et développent naturellement une culture de performance durable. C'est précisément là que <strong>le mouvement devient un levier puissant</strong>.
      </p>
      <div class="mission-pillars">
        <div class="mpillar"><div class="mpillar-n">↑</div><div class="mpillar-l">Énergie</div></div>
        <div class="mpillar"><div class="mpillar-n">↑</div><div class="mpillar-l">Cohésion</div></div>
        <div class="mpillar"><div class="mpillar-n">↑</div><div class="mpillar-l">Performance</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mission-visual">
      <div class="mission-quote-block">
        <p class="mission-quote">
          "Lorsque les individus bougent ensemble, quelque chose change. Les barrières tombent. Les échanges deviennent plus naturels. La confiance se développe. L'énergie circule différemment."
        </p>
        <div class="mission-quote-attr">— Hervé Ngongo, Fondateur</div>
